d the complete exit from the legacy trading and marketing segment using the 110% BG model. The company is actively pursuing new digital initiatives such as an electronic trading platform for EPR certificates, a TReDS platform, and a B2B travel portal, while maintaining an asset-light model. Additionally, the Mahindra joint venture (MMRPL) turned profitable during the quarter, supported by favourable government policies on automobile scrapping and extended producer responsibility.","themes":{"guidance":[],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Management expects the positive trend in feedstock inflows and financial performance for the Mahindra joint venture to strengthen and continue.","quote":"And we expect this trend to strengthen and continue, driving towards a healthy financial outlook for this company.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"EBITDA percentage of total income was 69.05%, which is nearly 3% higher than the corresponding period of FY26.","quote":"EBITDA percentage of total income was 69.05%, also nearly 3% higher than the corresponding period of FY26.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"},{"claim":"Standalone EBITDA reached INR 81.49 crore in 2026-27-Q1 compared to INR 61.88 crore in 2025-26-Q1.","quote":"EBITDA of INR 81.49 crore in 2026-27-Q1 vis-\u00e0-vis INR 61.88 crore in 2025-26-Q1.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=453eafe2-cf15-4469-bad8-0c92f3007ac3.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"The company has completely exited from the trading and marketing segment after recovering dues on the 110% BG model.","quote":"We had taken a decision in FY26 to completely exit from the trading and marketing segment and have seamlessly recovered our dues on the 110% BG model, closing the chapter on this legacy segment in this quarter.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"Management stated that subject to regulatory approvals, they should be able to operationalize the TReDS platform sometime during FY27.","quote":"This project is also at an advanced stage and subject to regulatory approvals being obtained, we should be able to operationalize this sometime during this FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"},{"claim":"Management stated an internal target to hopefully obtain RBI approval and operationalize the TReDS platform within FY27.","quote":"So, our internal target is hopefully FY27, within FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"},{"claim":"MSTC is developing a TREDs platform and has applied to RBI for requisite clearance.","quote":"\u2022 MSTC is developing a TREDs platform and has applied to RBI for requisite clearance.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=453eafe2-cf15-4469-bad8-0c92f3007ac3.pdf","timeframe":""}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":2,"kinds":["concall_transcript","concall_ppt"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":7,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":3,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped. Skipped \u2014 concall_transcript: RemoteProtocolError: Server disconnected with